<h1>st-digraph</h1>
<p>
(data structure)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
A <a href="directAcycGraph.html"><em>directed acyclic graph</em></a> with two specially marked nodes, the <a href="source.html"><em>source</em></a> s and the <a href="sink.html"><em>sink</em></a> t.
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="flownetwork.html"><em>flow network</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<em>Note:
After P. Bertolazzi, G. Di Battista, and W. Didimo, <em>Quasi-upward planarity</em>, Algorithmica, 32:474-506 (2002).</em>
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

<hr>

